*   **Strong Runway & Cash Position:** With $5.2M in cash and a 30-month runway at a $72K/month burn rate, Summit Software is in a highly stable position. This shows investors or internal stakeholders that the company is capital-efficient and has plenty of time to scale without needing immediate fundraising.
